  "title": {
    "zh_CN": "第三课 · 音准模唱",
    "en_US": "Lesson 3 · Pitch matching"
  },
  "goal": {
    "zh_CN": "先记住目标音，再由单音发展到两音、三音模唱。",
    "en_US": "Remember a target and progress from one-note to short-phrase imitation."
  },
  "steps": {
    "zh_CN": "1. 选择听力页的单音模唱：先听，示范结束后唱回去。\n2. 每次先在心里回忆声音，再开口。\n3. 回到课程谱练习两音、三音。\n4. 查看偏高或偏低，重听后再试。",
    "en_US": "1. Use Single-note echo in Ear training; sing only after the example stops.\n2. Recall the sound before singing.\n3. Practise the two- and three-note phrases in the lesson.\n4. Review high/low feedback, listen again, and retry."
  },
  "selfCheck": {
    "zh_CN": "是否先听后唱？是否把唱偏方向调整对了？",
    "en_US": "Did you listen before singing? Did you correct in the right direction?"
  },
